        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play through 54 levels while strategically placing and directing chess pieces to break open all present treasure chests on a given chess board.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level has a unique chess board with holes, walls, and more to navigate around.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pieces can't be fully controlled, as they will continue in whichever direction you set them off in, so be sure to think before placing and directing them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throughout the game pieces will be introduced, starting at pawns, then  rooks, bishops, and knights. There can be pieces of both colors too!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you master the quirks of the movements and interactions of pieces and tiles?</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play through 54 levels while strategically placing and directing chess pieces to break open all present treasure chests on a given chess board.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level has a unique chess board with holes, walls, and more to navigate around.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pieces can't be fully controlled, as they will continue in whichever direction you set them off in, so be sure to think before placing and directing them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throughout the game pieces will be introduced, starting at pawns, then  rooks, bishops, and knights. There can be pieces of both colors too!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you master the quirks of the movements and interactions of pieces and tiles?</p>",
